  "title": "Delivery complications Choices Display Values",
  "description": "Display values for Delivery complications Choices ValueSet codes. Generated from FHIR expansions. Keys are code fragments (the part after '#' in the canonical IRI). The full IRI can be reconstructed as system + '#' + code.",
